## Notes on Arguments and Attributes

- `context`: Context of the query (e.g. `environment_aware`)
- `model`: The OpenAI model to use (e.g. `gpt-3.5-turbo`, `gpt-4`)
- `id`: Set to `chat-{environment_id}`
